## Session skills

- `bro`: re-explains the previous answer, a file, a spec item (`REQ-003`) or a term in plain language, in a few lines.
- `closing`: before ending a session, checks every durable artifact is up to date and writes a handoff so a fresh session can resume from the files.

Invoke them by name with this harness's skill invocation; their instructions live in `{{HARNESS_DIR}}/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`.

